    HTTPClient event tests: requests are served by the connections of the client's connection manager,
    which are shared between requests, so every assertion here is about the events of one request
    reaching the queue of the client that issued it — including the receive event, which must be reported
    while the response body is still outstanding, so that a client can act on the response header.
*/

%prepend-module-path "${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../../../../qlib"
%requires QUnit
%requires Util
%requires Logger
%requires HttpServerUtil
%requires HttpServer

%exec-class HttpClientEventsTest

